  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  noteText: 'Assignment:

    Make the door disappear when you walk over the pressure
    plate.


    Note:

    DON''T apply the changes to any of the Prefabs because
    it will mess up all the other demo scenes. Although in a real life scenario,
    you would apply the changes OR create prefab variants, in this case it also allows
    you to clearly see the CHANGES done in a Scene, with respect to the base prefab.'
  noteType: 0
